  {:gate/id "G2" :gate/name "selective-regenerative"   :gate/rule "Selective + regenerative harvest only; clear-cut + old-growth/protected-species felling unrepresentable; extraction refuses over-grade / over-ground-pressure / protected soil (no rutting/compaction beyond bearing)"}
  {:gate/id "G3" :gate/name "no-worker-surveillance"   :gate/rule "KPI is m³/hour + value/volume (equipment metrics), never per-worker pace or biometric tracking (§1.13)"}
  {:gate/id "G4" :gate/name "dividend-coupled"         :gate/rule "Forestry-labour displacement is coupled to a funded Displacement-Dividend cohort (ADR-2606032130 G2); no live displacement without it"}
  {:gate/id "G5" :gate/name "exclusion-zone-fell-safety" :gate/rule "safe-fell? RAISES when the predicted fall zone (≈1.5× tree height sector) overlaps ANY exclusion/human/road/watercourse point — fall fatality is the #1 logging hazard; never silently planned"}
  {:gate/id "G6" :gate/name "murakumo-only"            :gate/rule "Inference/narration is Murakumo-only (LiteLLM 127.0.0.1:4000); external LLM prohibited (ADR-2605215000)"}
  {:gate/id "G7" :gate/name "protected-species-refusal" :gate/rule "A protected species or a no-cut flag (old-growth / seed-tree) on a tree REFUSES felling (plan-fell RAISES) — never silently forced"}
